[161.533215, "i", "cat << 'EOF' > /app/progress.md\n# DFIR Investigation Progress & Working Checklist\n\n## Affected Host & Incident Summary\n- **Host**: `rdp-prod-01` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:5`)\n- **OS**: Windows Server 2022 (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/SOFTWARE:3`)\n- **Attacker Origin IP**: `198.51.100.92` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:6`, `/disk/Windows/System32/svc-helper.sys:9`)\n- **Initial Vector**: RDP brute force login enabled by Network Level Authentication (NLA) disabled (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/RDP-Tcp.reg:4`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:12`)\n\n---\n\n## Investigation Timeline\n\n- **2026-08-13 03:20 UTC**: EDR triggers high-severity alert cluster (`/sas/handoff/intake.pdf:5`).\n- **2026-08-13**: Attacker executes RDP credential brute force (T1110) against exposed RDP service (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:12`).\n- **2026-08-13**: Attacker logs on via RDP (T1021.001) (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:13`, `/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/Security.evtx:3`).\n- **2026-08-13**: Attacker executes PowerShell commands (T1059.001) (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:14`).\n- **2026-08-13**: Attacker drops ransomware payload `svc.exe` at `/disk/Users/Public/svc.exe` and executes encryption (T1486) (`/sas/alerts.json:3`, `/disk/Users/Public/svc.exe:1`).\n- **2026-08-13**: Attacker creates scheduled task `UpdateHelper` launching `svc.exe` every 5 minutes for persistence (T1053.005) (`/sas/alerts.json:11`, `/disk/Windows/System32/Tasks/UpdateHelper:2`).\n- **2026-08-13**: Attacker installs malicious Windows service `svc-helper` (T1543.003) (`/sas/alerts.json:19`, `/disk/Windows/System32/svc-helper.sys:5`, `/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/System.evtx:2`).\n- **2026-08-13**: Attacker establishes silent Registry Run key persistence `svc` -> `C:\\Users\\Public\\svc.exe` (T1547.001) (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/SOFTWARE:2`).\n- **2026-08-13**: Attacker clears Windows Security Event Log (EventID 1102) for anti-forensic log tampering (T1070.001) (`/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/Security.evtx:2`).\n\n---\n\n## Working Checklist & Findings Reconciliation\n\n| Item | Finding | Catego"]
[161.533277, "i", "ry | Status | Evidence Citation |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| CHK-01 | Ransomware payload `svc.exe` | Impact / Malware | Alerted | `/disk/Users/Public/svc.exe:1`, `/sas/alerts.json:3` |\n| CHK-02 | Scheduled task `UpdateHelper` | Persistence | Alerted | `/disk/Windows/System32/Tasks/UpdateHelper:2`, `/sas/alerts.json:11` |\n| CHK-04 | Malicious service `svc-helper` | Persistence | Alerted | `/disk/Windows/System32/svc-helper.sys:5`, `/sas/alerts.json:19` |\n| CHK-06 | NLA Disabled (`UserAuthentication = 0`) | Baseline Defect | Alerted | `/disk/Windows/System32/config/RDP-Tcp.reg:4`, `/sas/alerts.json:27` |\n| SILENT-01 | Registry Run key `svc` -> `C:\\Users\\Public\\svc.exe` | Persistence | Silent (Unalerted) | `/disk/Windows/System32/config/SOFTWARE:2` |\n| SILENT-02 | Security Event Log Cleared (EventID 1102) | Anti-Forensics | Silent (Unalerted) | `/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/Security.evtx:2` |\n| VULN-01 | Vulnerability scan result | Vulnerability | Verified Empty | `/sas/vulns.json:1` |\n| CHG-01 | Change Ticket Row 1 (IP) | Remediation | Corrected | `/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:9`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:6` |\n| CHG-02 | Change Ticket Row 2 (CVE) | Remediation | Corrected | `/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:10`, `/sas/vulns.json:1` |\n| CHG-03 | Change Ticket Row 3 (Cron miner) | Remediation | Corrected | `/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:11`, `/disk/Windows/System32/Tasks/UpdateHelper:2` |\n| CHG-04 | Change Ticket Row 4 (Silent items) | Remediation | Reconciled | `/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:12`, `/disk/Windows/System32/config/SOFTWARE:2` |\nEOF\n"]
