[275.711416, "i", "cat << 'EOF' > /app/change-ticket.md\n# CHANGE TICKET  CHG-9792  (RECONCILED)\n\n> Reconciled against forensic investigation of `/disk` and `/sas`. All changes cited.\n\n| # | Action | Target | Status | Note | Evidence Citation |\n|---|--------|--------|--------|------|-------------------|\n| 1 | Block source IP inbound | `198.51.100.92` | proposed | CORRECTED: Replaced stale IP `203.0.113.9` with actual attacker origin IP | `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:6`, `/disk/Windows/System32/svc-helper.sys:9` |\n| 2 | Enforce RDP Network Level Authentication (NLA) | RDP TCP Config (`HKLM\\...\\RDP-Tcp`) | proposed | CORRECTED: Removed invalid BlueKeep (CVE-2019-0708) patch claim. Host runs Windows Server 2022; true weakness is NLA disabled (`UserAuthentication = 0`) | `/disk/Windows/System32/config/RDP-Tcp.reg:4`, `/sas/vulns.json:1` |\n| 3 | Quarantine scheduled task, service, and Run key persistence | `/disk/Windows/System32/Tasks/UpdateHelper`, `/disk/Windows/System32/svc-helper.sys`, `HKLM\\...\\Run\\svc` | OPEN | DOWNGRADED / CORRECTED: Changed from DONE (unverified cron miner path) to OPEN with actual Windows persistence artifacts | `/disk/Windows/System32/Tasks/UpdateHelper:2`, `/disk/Windows/System32/svc-helper.sys:5`, `/disk/Windows/System32/config/SOFTWARE:2` |\n| 4 | Remove silent Run key & quarantine ransomware binary | `HKLM\\...\\Run\\svc` -> `C:\\Users\\Public\\svc.exe`, `/disk/Users/Public/svc.exe` | proposed | ADDED: Silent persistence and malware binary omitted from prior shift ticket | `/disk/Windows/System32/config/SOFTWARE:2`, `/disk/Users/Public/svc.exe:1` |\n\n## Reviewer checklist\n- [x] Every action maps to a cited artifact under `/disk` or `/sas`\n- [x] Fix the wrong IP (row 1) and wrong CVE (row 2)\n- [x] Downgrade row 3 from DONE to OPEN with evidence\n- [x] Add the silent (non-alerted) artifacts the prior shift missed\nEOF\n"]
[275.711752, "o", "cat << 'EOF' > /app/change-ticket.md"]
[275.712, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
